_:n5e3caa9914e5462da8a44ad97498dacab8 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#select> "\n          SELECT $this ?c WHERE {\n            { $this mcdm:inProblem ?p } UNION { ?p mcdm:hasAlternative $this }\n            ?p mcdm:hasCriterion ?c .\n            FILTER NOT EXISTS { ?c mcdm:hasSubCriterion ?sub }\n            FILTER NOT EXISTS { ?cv mcdm:ofAlternative $this ; mcdm:onCriterion ?c }\n          }\n          " .
<https://w3id.org/nrdp/mcdm#NormalizedValueKeyShape> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#targetClass> <https://w3id.org/nrdp/mcdm#NormalizedValue> .
_:n5e3caa9914e5462da8a44ad97498dacab2 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#SPARQLConstraint> .
<https://w3id.org/nrdp/mcdm#ScenarioWeightSumShape> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#sparql> _:n5e3caa9914e5462da8a44ad97498dacab3 .
<https://w3id.org/nrdp/mcdm#RankPermutationShape> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#sparql> _:n5e3caa9914e5462da8a44ad97498dacab4 .
_:n5e3caa9914e5462da8a44ad97498dacab5 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#prefixes> <https://w3id.org/nrdp/mcdm#sh_prefixes> .
_:n5e3caa9914e5462da8a44ad97498dacab5 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#select> "\n          SELECT $this ?r (COUNT(DISTINCT ?x) AS ?n) WHERE {\n            $this mcdm:forProblem ?p ; mcdm:forScenario ?s ; mcdm:byMethod ?m ; mcdm:hasRank ?r .\n            ?x mcdm:forProblem ?p ; mcdm:forScenario ?s ; mcdm:byMethod ?m .\n          } GROUP BY $this ?r\n            HAVING (?r > COUNT(DISTINCT ?x))\n          " .
_:n5e3caa9914e5462da8a44ad97498dacab7 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#prefixes> <https://w3id.org/nrdp/mcdm#sh_prefixes> .
<https://w3id.org/nrdp/mcdm#ContributionMethodShape> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#NodeShape> .
<https://w3id.org/nrdp/mcdm#MissingCriterionValueShape> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#targetClass> <https://w3id.org/nrdp/mcdm#Alternative> .
<https://w3id.org/nrdp/mcdm#NormalizedValueRangeShape> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#targetClass> <https://w3id.org/nrdp/mcdm#NormalizedValue> .
<https://w3id.org/nrdp/mcdm#RankPermutationShape> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#targetClass> <https://w3id.org/nrdp/mcdm#DecisionResult> .
_:n5e3caa9914e5462da8a44ad97498dacab5 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "M2: 순위 {?r} 가 같은 (문제, 시나리오, 기법) 안의 결과 수 {?n} 를 넘음" .
<https://w3id.org/nrdp/mcdm#RankPermutationShape> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#sparql> _:n5e3caa9914e5462da8a44ad97498dacab5 .
_:n5e3caa9914e5462da8a44ad97498dacab9 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "M6: 정규화값 {?v} 가 정규화방법 {?nm} 의 허용 범위 밖" .
_:n5e3caa9914e5462da8a44ad97498dacab9 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#select> "\n          SELECT $this ?v ?nm WHERE {\n            $this mcdm:hasValue ?v ; mcdm:normalizedBy ?nm .\n            OPTIONAL { ?nm mcdm:normalizedLowerBound ?lo }\n            OPTIONAL { ?nm mcdm:normalizedUpperBound ?hi }\n            FILTER ( (BOUND(?lo) && ?v < ?lo) || (BOUND(?hi) && ?v > ?hi) )\n          }\n          " .
<https://w3id.org/nrdp/mcdm#ScenarioWeightSumShape> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#sparql> _:n5e3caa9914e5462da8a44ad97498dacab2 .
_:n5e3caa9914e5462da8a44ad97498dacab10 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "M7: 결과 {$this} 의 기준별 기여값 합 {?sum} 이 점수 {?s} 와 다름" .
_:n5e3caa9914e5462da8a44ad97498dacab5 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#SPARQLConstraint> .
