<https://w3id.org/nrdp/mcdm#sh_prefixes> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Ontology> .
_:n5e3caa9914e5462da8a44ad97498dacab7 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#SPARQLConstraint> .
<https://w3id.org/nrdp/mcdm#NormalizedValueKeyShape> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#sparql> _:n5e3caa9914e5462da8a44ad97498dacab7 .
_:n5e3caa9914e5462da8a44ad97498dacab6 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#prefixes> <https://w3id.org/nrdp/mcdm#sh_prefixes> .
