<https://w3id.org/nrdp/mcdm#NormalizedValueKeyShape> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#NodeShape> .
<https://w3id.org/nrdp/mcdm#MissingCriterionValueShape> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#sparql> _:n5e3caa9914e5462da8a44ad97498dacab8 .
_:n5e3caa9914e5462da8a44ad97498dacab8 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "M5: 대안 {$this} 의 리프 기준 {?c} 평가값 없음" .
_:n5e3caa9914e5462da8a44ad97498dacab9 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#prefixes> <https://w3id.org/nrdp/mcdm#sh_prefixes> .
<https://w3id.org/nrdp/mcdm#ContributionMethodShape> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#targetClass> <https://w3id.org/nrdp/mcdm#CriterionContribution> .
