_:n5e3caa9914e5462da8a44ad97498dacab9 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#SPARQLConstraint> .
_:n5e3caa9914e5462da8a44ad97498dacab2 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#prefixes> <https://w3id.org/nrdp/mcdm#sh_prefixes> .
<https://w3id.org/nrdp/mcdm#ScenarioWeightSumShape> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#targetClass> <https://w3id.org/nrdp/mcdm#DecisionScenario> .
_:n5e3caa9914e5462da8a44ad97498dacab3 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "M1: 시나리오 {$this} 에서 기준 {?c} 에 가중치가 둘 이상 부여됨" .
<https://w3id.org/nrdp/mcdm#RankPermutationShape> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#NodeShape> .
<https://w3id.org/nrdp/mcdm#MissingCriterionValueShape> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#severity> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#Warning> .
_:n5e3caa9914e5462da8a44ad97498dacab10 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#prefixes> <https://w3id.org/nrdp/mcdm#sh_prefixes> .
_:n5e3caa9914e5462da8a44ad97498dacab7 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "M4: 평가값 {?cv} 와 정규화방법 {?nm} 쌍에 정규화값이 둘 이상" .
<https://w3id.org/nrdp/mcdm#NormalizedValueRangeShape> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#NodeShape> .
_:n5e3caa9914e5462da8a44ad97498dacab3 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#prefixes> <https://w3id.org/nrdp/mcdm#sh_prefixes> .
_:n5e3caa9914e5462da8a44ad97498dacab6 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "M3: 기여 분해 {$this} 의 대상 결과가 가산 분해를 지원하지 않는 기법 {?m} 의 산출임" .
_:n5e3caa9914e5462da8a44ad97498dacab10 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#SPARQLConstraint> .
_:n5e3caa9914e5462da8a44ad97498dacab3 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#SPARQLConstraint> .
_:n5e3caa9914e5462da8a44ad97498dacab4 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "M2: 순위 {?r} 가 같은 (문제, 시나리오, 기법) 안의 다른 결과 {?y} 와 중복" .
_:n5e3caa9914e5462da8a44ad97498dacab8 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#prefixes> <https://w3id.org/nrdp/mcdm#sh_prefixes> .
<https://w3id.org/nrdp/mcdm#ContributionSumShape> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#sparql> _:n5e3caa9914e5462da8a44ad97498dacab10 .
_:n5e3caa9914e5462da8a44ad97498dacab8 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#SPARQLConstraint> .
_:n5e3caa9914e5462da8a44ad97498dacab1 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#namespace> "https://w3id.org/nrdp/mcdm#"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#anyURI> .
_:n5e3caa9914e5462da8a44ad97498dacab2 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "M1: 시나리오 {$this} 의 가중치 합이 {?sum} (1이어야 함)" .
_:n5e3caa9914e5462da8a44ad97498dacab4 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#select> "\n          SELECT $this ?r ?y WHERE {\n            $this mcdm:forProblem ?p ; mcdm:forScenario ?s ; mcdm:byMethod ?m ; mcdm:hasRank ?r .\n            ?y mcdm:forProblem ?p ; mcdm:forScenario ?s ; mcdm:byMethod ?m ; mcdm:hasRank ?r .\n            FILTER (?y != $this)\n          }\n          " .
_:n5e3caa9914e5462da8a44ad97498dacab3 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#select> "\n          SELECT $this ?c WHERE {\n            $this mcdm:hasWeight ?w1 , ?w2 .\n            ?w1 mcdm:assignedToCriterion ?c . ?w2 mcdm:assignedToCriterion ?c .\n            FILTER (?w1 != ?w2)\n          } GROUP BY $this ?c\n          " .
<https://w3id.org/nrdp/mcdm#ScenarioWeightSumShape> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#NodeShape> .
_:n5e3caa9914e5462da8a44ad97498dacab7 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#select> "\n          SELECT $this ?cv ?nm WHERE {\n            $this mcdm:ofCriterionValue ?cv ; mcdm:normalizedBy ?nm .\n            ?o mcdm:ofCriterionValue ?cv ; mcdm:normalizedBy ?nm .\n            FILTER (?o != $this)\n          }\n          " .
<https://w3id.org/nrdp/mcdm#ContributionSumShape> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#NodeShape> .
_:n5e3caa9914e5462da8a44ad97498dacab6 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#select> "\n          SELECT $this ?m WHERE {\n            $this mcdm:explains ?dr . ?dr mcdm:byMethod ?m .\n            FILTER NOT EXISTS { ?m mcdm:supportsAdditiveDecomposition true }\n          }\n          " .
_:n5e3caa9914e5462da8a44ad97498dacab10 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#select> "\n          SELECT $this ?s (SUM(?v) AS ?sum) WHERE {\n            $this mcdm:hasScore ?s .\n            ?cc mcdm:explains $this ; mcdm:hasContributionValue ?v .\n          } GROUP BY $this ?s\n            HAVING (ABS(SUM(?v) - ?s) > 0.0001)\n          " .
_:n5e3caa9914e5462da8a44ad97498dacab6 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#SPARQLConstraint> .
_:n5e3caa9914e5462da8a44ad97498dacab4 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#SPARQLConstraint> .
<https://w3id.org/nrdp/mcdm#NormalizedValueRangeShape> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#sparql> _:n5e3caa9914e5462da8a44ad97498dacab9 .
<https://w3id.org/nrdp/mcdm#sh_prefixes> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#declare> _:n5e3caa9914e5462da8a44ad97498dacab1 .
_:n5e3caa9914e5462da8a44ad97498dacab2 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#select> "\n          SELECT $this (SUM(?v) AS ?sum) WHERE {\n            $this mcdm:hasWeight ?w .\n            OPTIONAL { ?w mcdm:hasWeightValue ?wv }\n            BIND (COALESCE(?wv, 0) AS ?v)\n          } GROUP BY $this\n            HAVING (ABS(SUM(?v) - 1.0) > 0.0001)\n          " .
<https://w3id.org/nrdp/mcdm#ContributionSumShape> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#targetClass> <https://w3id.org/nrdp/mcdm#DecisionResult> .
<https://w3id.org/nrdp/mcdm#MissingCriterionValueShape> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#NodeShape> .
